	(text "PGOOD is PUSH-PULL (ADuM4165 Table 18, p.15) -- drives both High and Low, never open-drain.\nR10 stays populated, R9 stays DNP -- never populate both.\nIf R9 is ever populated, pull-up MUST go to VDD2, NEVER ISO_5V. PGOOD abs max = VDD2+0.5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
