	(text "CY1 -- barrier stitching. POPULATED, not DNP. Gives GND2's ESD current a\ndefined return to GND1 instead of forcing it through the ADuM4165 die. Y1\nsafety-rated, 14 mm pitch, clears the 8.3 mm barrier. Do NOT substitute v2's\n2220 SMD part -- its body spans only 5.7 mm and would cut the barrier below\n8.3 mm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 248.92 0)
